1. BACKGROUND

This software is the backend API developed by Diego Lucas Hattori Dallaqua as an undergraduate thesis (Trabalho de Conclusão de Curso - TCC) for the Computer Science program at Universidade Tecnológica Federal do Paraná, for the Rede Campo research group. It provides the server-side services consumed by the companion Flutter front-end application.

The Rede Campo group uses its own modified version of this software. That version is not part of this repository, and its use is governed by a separate agreement between the parties. This license does not limit or alter that agreement.

